<body>
    <h1>API Gateway Setup</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p>The purpose of this guide is to provide instruction for utilizin=
g Sharpen=E2=80=99s API Gateway.</p>
<p>The API Gateway is Sharpen=E2=80=99s external API interface to microserv=
ice-based functions. If you=E2=80=99re dealing with an API that contains <a=
 class=3D"external-link" href=3D"http://api.sharpencx.com" rel=3D"nofollow"=
>api.sharpencx.com</a> or <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"http://api.fat=
homvoice.com" rel=3D"nofollow">api.fathomvoice.com</a>, this is not the api=
 gateway. Instead the api gateway will contain <a class=3D"external-link" h=
ref=3D"http://api.sharpen.cx" rel=3D"nofollow">api.sharpen.cx</a> or <a cla=
ss=3D"external-link" href=3D"http://api.iz1.sharpen.cx" rel=3D"nofollow">ap=
i.iz1.sharpen.cx</a> in its URL.</p>
<p>Whereas the legacy api leveraged cKey1 and cKey2 on behalf of the organi=
zation as a whole, the api gateway leverages user-based api keys and secret=
s based on a unique JWT (Json Web Token). The api gateway leverages POST, G=
ET, PUT, DELETE, etc. methods instead of just POST from the legacy API.</p>
<h1 id=3D"APIGatewaySetup-TableofContents"><strong>Table of Contents</stron=
g></h1>
<hr>
<div class=3D"toc-macro">
<a href=3D"#APIGatewaySetup-TableofContents">Table of Contents</a> | <a hre=
f=3D"#APIGatewaySetup-Wheretoaccess">Where to access</a> | <a href=3D"#APIG=
atewaySetup-ImportingCollectionintoPostman">Importing Collection into Postm=
an</a> | <a href=3D"#APIGatewaySetup-Settingupauthorization">Setting up aut=
horization</a> | <a href=3D"#APIGatewaySetup-ExecutingAPIcalls">Executing A=
PI calls</a> | <a href=3D"#APIGatewaySetup-ExamplesQUERYExamples">QUERY Exa=
mples</a>
</div>
<hr>
<h1 id=3D"APIGatewaySetup-Wheretoaccess">Where to access</h1>
<p>The API gateway api calls and documentation can be accessed one of two w=
ays; the API Gateway web page, or the preconfigured collection from the Pos=
tman collection below. The preconfigured collection contains configurations=
 and examples for Authorization and common SharpenDB2 requests.<span class=
=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"APIGatewaySetup-API_gateway_docs"><span c=
lass=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"API_gateway_docs"></span></span></p>
<p><strong>API Gateway documentation: </strong><a class=3D"external-link" h=
ref=3D"https://api.sharpen.cx/docs#" rel=3D"nofollow"><strong>IZ0 Sharpen P=
ublic API</strong></a><strong>, </strong><a class=3D"external-link" href=3D=
"https://api.iz1.sharpen.cx/docs#" rel=3D"nofollow"><strong>IZ1 Sharpen Pub=
lic API</strong></a></p>
<p><strong>Postman download: </strong><a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"ht=
tps://www.postman.com/downloads/" rel=3D"nofollow"><em>Postman download</em=
></a></p>
<p><em>While there are many REST API tools available, we recommend Postman.=
 The export below is in Postman json export v2.1</em></p>
<p><strong>API Gateway Postman export: </strong></p>
<p class=3D"media-group"><img height=3D"250" style=3D"margin: 2px; border: =
1px solid #ddd; box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: text-bottom;" src=
=3D"a6ab1fda49c43279e27fd5e78538e018919aa4e2c14277068aaa6a566a57eb80" width=
=3D"250"></p>
<h1 id=3D"APIGatewaySetup-ImportingCollectionintoPostman">Importing Collect=
ion into Postman</h1>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Download Postman <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://www.postman.=
com/downloads/" rel=3D"nofollow">here</a></p></li>
<li>
<p>Install Postman</p></li>
<li>
<p>Using Postman, import the API collection above</p><span class=3D"conflue=
nce-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-s=
ize"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-center" width=3D"306" lo=
ading=3D"lazy" src=3D"22518db980d7a4b926abada2716dd281e2ffa340b411b13657dd3=
d7b583ed66c" data-image-src=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki/downloa=
d/attachments/3004301360/image-20211230-202636.png?version=3D1&amp;modifica=
tionDate=3D1640895998562&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"=
432" data-width=3D"427" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-res=
ource-id=3D"3054010467" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-reso=
urce-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-202112=
30-202636.png" data-base-url=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki" data-=
linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-i=
d=3D"3004301360" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"19" data-media-i=
d=3D"2b2db21c-99a5-431f-ad61-97793dbee944" data-media-type=3D"file" height=
=3D"309"></span></li>
</ol>
<h1 id=3D"APIGatewaySetup-Settingupauthorization">Setting up authorization<=
/h1>
<p>In order to send API calls using the API gateway, a system of BearerAuth=
, apiKey, and apiSecret are used. The steps below will guide you through ob=
taining the apiKey and apiSecret which will be necessary. Please keep in mi=
nd that the user you=E2=80=99re authenticating with will be the user execut=
ing the API calls. It is highly recommended you create an automation user w=
ithin Sharpen which can persist through employee turnover.</p>
<h2 id=3D"APIGatewaySetup-Configurethe{{base_url}}">Configure the {{base_ur=
l}}</h2>
<p><em>Sharpen has two main isolation zones. Depending on which isolation z=
one you=E2=80=99re interfacing with, the api base url will be different. Th=
e Postman collection has a {{base_url}} variable which needs to be set to t=
he appropriate environment before getting started. Once set, this base_url =
will be used in any subsequent API call.</em></p>
<div class=3D"panel" style=3D"background-color: #B3F5FF;border-width: 1px;"=
>
<div class=3D"panelContent" style=3D"background-color: #B3F5FF;">
<p>By default, the base_url is set to <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"ht=
tps://api.iz1.sharpen.cx/v1" rel=3D"nofollow">https://api.iz1.sharpen.cx/v1=
</a>. Please adjust this configuration if you=E2=80=99re using IZ0.</p>
</div>
</div>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Navigate to the =E2=80=98API Gateway Setup=E2=80=99 folder in Postman fr=
om your recently imported collection.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Choose the =E2=80=98Variables=E2=80=99 tab.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Check the box next to the appropriate "base_url" variable to correspond =
with the isolation zone in use.</p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Only 1 may be checked.</p></li>
<li>
<p>If you login to <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://app.sharpencx=
.com" rel=3D"nofollow"><strong>app.sharpencx.com</strong></a>, then use <a =
class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://api.sharpen.cx/v1" rel=3D"nofollow"=
><em><strong>https://api.sharpen.cx/v1</strong></em></a> as your base url.<=
/p></li>
<li>
<p>If you login to <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://app.iz1.sharp=
en.cx" rel=3D"nofollow"><strong>app.iz1.sharpen.cx</strong></a>, then use <=
a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://api.iz1.sharpen.cx" rel=3D"nofoll=
ow"><em><strong>https://api.iz1.sharpen.cx/v1</strong></em></a> as your bas=
e url.</p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrap=
per"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-center" loading=3D"lazy"=
 src=3D"1d5a3626bcdd070223f9cef9283e0a1a4e863d32a3ef530b73d61d34d40edf4f" d=
ata-image-src=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/=
3004301360/image-20220408-151226.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D164=
9430748774&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"273" data-widt=
h=3D"805" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"31=
39403784" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"a=
ttachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-20220408-151226.png"=
 data-base-url=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resourc=
e-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"300430136=
0" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"19" data-media-id=3D"2e587907-=
c8f2-4049-8f99-9d5e77b12b63" data-media-type=3D"file" width=3D"468" height=
=3D"158"></span></li>
</ol></li>
<li>
<p>Click =E2=80=9CSave=E2=80=9D at the top right.</p></li>
</ol>
<h2 id=3D"APIGatewaySetup-GatheringyourJWT(JsonWebToken)">Gathering your JW=
T(<em>Json Web Token</em>)</h2>
<h3 id=3D"APIGatewaySetup-CreateAuthorizationAPIcallmethod">Create Authoriz=
ation API call method</h3>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Navigate to the =E2=80=98Create New Authentication=E2=80=99 API call und=
er the =E2=80=98Authorization setup' folder</p></li>
<li>
<p>Identify the =E2=80=98Authorization=E2=80=99 tab once selecting the api =
from the folder list</p></li>
<li>
<p>Choose =E2=80=98Basic Auth=E2=80=99 from the drop down</p></li>
<li>
<p>Enter the credentials of the Sharpen account corresponding with the acco=
unt you=E2=80=99re interfacing with</p></li>
<li>
<p>Click =E2=80=98Send=E2=80=99</p></li>
<li>
<p>Response should look like</p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wra=
pper image-center-wrapper"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-ce=
nter" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"cafe3865f649b56cf6255367c95675d5ce4e94bba0cf0=
247ef3ba59837ca7162" data-image-src=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki=
/download/attachments/3004301360/image-20210903-200003.png?version=3D1&amp;=
modificationDate=3D1636030039895&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-he=
ight=3D"740" data-width=3D"1241" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-l=
inked-resource-id=3D"3004530717" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-li=
nked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"ima=
ge-20210903-200003.png" data-base-url=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wi=
ki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-co=
ntainer-id=3D"3004301360" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"19" dat=
a-media-id=3D"59db33a3-ddd3-41ad-95c0-4a0a754f081f" data-media-type=3D"file=
" width=3D"468" height=3D"279"></span></li>
</ol>
<h3 id=3D"APIGatewaySetup-LogintoAppmethod(alternativetothemethodabove)">Lo=
gin to App method (alternative to the method above)</h3>
<div id=3D"expander-2058343984" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-2058343984" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"7b305f1b059c25a2366907404eda05b8514f10=
2a3f39e06ed23a6f2f57d840b3" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">Process</span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-2058343984" class=3D"expand-content">
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Identify Sharpen account you will be executing the API call against</p><=
/li>
<li>
<p>Login to that account via <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"http://app.=
sharpencx.com" rel=3D"nofollow">app.sharpencx.com</a> or <a class=3D"extern=
al-link" href=3D"http://app.iz1.sharpen.cx" rel=3D"nofollow">app.iz1.sharpe=
n.cx</a></p></li>
<li>
<p>After logging in, right-click in an empty space on the page, and choose =
=E2=80=98Inspect=E2=80=99</p></li>
<li>
<p>Navigate to the =E2=80=98Application=E2=80=99 tab</p></li>
<li>
<p>Under =E2=80=98Storage=E2=80=99 on the left side, expand =E2=80=98Sessio=
n Storage=E2=80=99</p></li>
<li>
<p>Identify =E2=80=98apiAuthToken=E2=80=99</p></li>
<li>
<p>The string in the =E2=80=98Value=E2=80=99 field is your token</p></li>
</ol>
</div>
</div>
<h2 id=3D"APIGatewaySetup-GatheringapiKeyandapiSecret">Gathering apiKey and=
 apiSecret</h2>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Navigate to the =E2=80=98Create API Key=E2=80=99 api call under the =E2=
=80=98Authorization Setup=E2=80=99 folder within the imported Postman colle=
ction.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Click the =E2=80=98Authorization=E2=80=99 tab and make sure =E2=80=98Bea=
rer Token=E2=80=99 is chosen.</p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wr=
apper image-center-wrapper"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-c=
enter" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"35324bd8d7616097a57c32f5b5ade57dc027d44e53c3=
104c91314ee056e95be5" data-image-src=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wik=
i/download/attachments/3004301360/image-20210903-193258.png?version=3D1&amp=
;modificationDate=3D1636030039924&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-h=
eight=3D"296" data-width=3D"951" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-l=
inked-resource-id=3D"3004530723" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-li=
nked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"ima=
ge-20210903-193258.png" data-base-url=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wi=
ki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-co=
ntainer-id=3D"3004301360" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"19" dat=
a-media-id=3D"5c9b198d-f75e-47a6-81de-e44e014d4b1b" data-media-type=3D"file=
" width=3D"468" height=3D"145"></span></li>
<li>
<p>Insert the token gathered in step 6 of =E2=80=9CGathering your JWT=E2=80=
=9D here</p></li>
<li>
<p>Navigate to the =E2=80=98Body=E2=80=99 tab</p></li>
<li>
<p>If you want an expiration on the token, update the date/time to the prop=
er expiration time. If you do not want an expiration, modify the body to re=
flect.</p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrap=
per"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-center" loading=3D"lazy"=
 src=3D"c0135e9257c13a5d788cce8f9247fb0de0046a789f15b9e571e086ec99778bd5" d=
ata-image-src=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/=
3004301360/image-20230731-180504.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D169=
0826706360&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"265" data-widt=
