9-054580b59c55" data-media-type=3D"file" width=3D"468" height=3D"358"></spa=
n></li>
</ol>
<h2 id=3D"APIGatewaySetup-CreateColumn">Create Column</h2>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Identify the =E2=80=98SharpenDB2 Create Column=E2=80=99 request under th=
e =E2=80=98SharpenDB2-&gt;Columns=E2=80=99 folder in the Postman collection=
.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Under the =E2=80=98Headers=E2=80=99 tab update the <code>x-api-key</code=
> and <code>x-api-secret</code> values to match that of the values you retr=
ieved in =E2=80=9CGathering apiKey and apiSecret=E2=80=9D above.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Under the =E2=80=98Body=E2=80=99 tab enter your query in JSON format</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: jscript; gutter: false; theme: RDark" data-theme=3D"RDark">[
  {
    "field": "columnName",
    "type": "varchar(255)",
    "nullable": true,
    "default": "string"
  }
]</pre>
</div>
</div></li>
<li>
<p>Click =E2=80=98Send=E2=80=99</p></li>
<li>
<p>The request and response should look something like this=E2=80=A6</p><sp=
an class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper"><img cla=
ss=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-center" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"e92c4=
c3875f698ff282ca8a1b9b579b2422f191270bdfc3a581c193b595f5a2a" data-image-src=
=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/3004301360/im=
age-20220408-150127.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1649430090118&am=
p;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"812" data-width=3D"841" dat=
a-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"3140124675" dat=
