<h1 id=3D"APIGatewaySetup-ExamplesQUERYExamples"><span class=3D"confluence-=
anchor-link" id=3D"APIGatewaySetup-Examples"><span class=3D"confluence-anch=
or-link" id=3D"Examples"></span></span>QUERY Examples</h1>
<p>The examples below show how to convert common mySQL queries into json bo=
dies for the api requests above.</p>
<div id=3D"expander-1186167298" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-1186167298" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"7b305f1b059c25a2366907404eda05b8514f10=
2a3f39e06ed23a6f2f57d840b3" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">JSON Examples</span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-1186167298" class=3D"expand-content">
<h4 id=3D"APIGatewaySetup-SELECT">SELECT</h4>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: sql; gutter: false; theme: RDark" data-theme=3D"RDark">SELECT `file` FROM=
 SoundFiles WHERE `inboundNumber` =3D '5551234567'
{
  "type": "select",
  "fields": [ "file" ],
  "condition": [
    {
      "inboundNumber": {"$eq": "5551234567"}
    }
  ]
}</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h4 id=3D"APIGatewaySetup-SELECTwithJOIN">SELECT with JOIN</h4>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: sql; gutter: false; theme: RDark" data-theme=3D"RDark">SELECT * FROM Phon=
eNumbers JOIN Clients ON PhoneNumbers.number =3D Clients.number;
{
  "type": "select",
  "join": {
    "Clients": {
      "on": {"PhoneNumbers.number": "Clients.number"}
    }
  }
}</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h4 id=3D"APIGatewaySetup-INSERT">INSERT</h4>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: sql; gutter: false; theme: RDark" data-theme=3D"RDark">INSERT INTO Client=
s (name, age, number) VALUES ("John", 24, "5551234567");
{
  "type": "insert",
  "values": [
    {
      "name": "John",
      "age": 24,
      "number": "5551234567"
    }
  ]
}</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h4 id=3D"APIGatewaySetup-UPDATE">UPDATE</h4>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: sql; gutter: false; theme: RDark" data-theme=3D"RDark">UPDATE Clients SET=
 age =3D 25, number =3D "5552345678" WHERE name =3D 'John';
{
  "type": "update",
  "condition": {
    "name": "John"
  },
  "modifier": {
    "age": "25",
    "number": "5552345678"
  }
}</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h4 id=3D"APIGatewaySetup-DELETE">DELETE</h4>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: sql; gutter: false; theme: RDark" data-theme=3D"RDark">DELETE FROM Client=
s WHERE number =3D "5551234567";
{
  "type": "remove",
  "condition": {
    "number": "5551234567"
  }
}</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-74096687" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-74096687" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"7b305f1b059c25a2366907404eda05b8514f10=
2a3f39e06ed23a6f2f57d840b3" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">CX Examples</span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-74096687" class=3D"expand-content">
<h4 id=3D"APIGatewaySetup-CodeExample:"><br>
Code Example:</h4>
<p>The following example of code will return the entire contents of the tab=
le JSDLookup. Please note that the table name is listed in the CURLOPT_URL =
as part of the API call, and needs to be updated to the respective table on=
 your account.</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: jscript; gutter: false; theme: RDark" data-theme=3D"RDark">1&lt;?
2// Set API key/secret pair
3$apiKey =3D 'aaaa';
4$apiSecret =3D 'bbbb';
5
6// Define the API URL with the desired table name.
7$tableName =3D 'JSDLookup';
8$url =3D "https://api.sharpen.cx/v1/sharpendb/tables/" . $tableName . "/qu=
ery";
9
10// Define the query
11$q =3D '{
12    "type": "select",
13    "distinct" : false,
14    "limit": 100,
15    "offset": 0,
16    "count": false
17}';
18
19// Define the api key/secret pair and the content type as json.
20$headers =3D array(
21    "content-type: application/json",
22    "x-api-key: " . $apiKey,
23    "x-api-secret: " . $apiSecret
24);
25$curl =3D curl_init();
26curl_setopt_array($curl, array(
27  CURLOPT_URL =3D&gt; $url,
28  CURLOPT_RETURNTRANSFER =3D&gt; true,
29  CURLOPT_ENCODING =3D&gt; "",
30  CURLOPT_MAXREDIRS =3D&gt; 10,
31  CURLOPT_TIMEOUT =3D&gt; 5,
32  CURLOPT_HTTP_VERSION =3D&gt; CURL_HTTP_VERSION_1_1,
33  CURLOPT_CUSTOMREQUEST =3D&gt; "POST",
34  CURLOPT_POSTFIELDS =3D&gt; $q,
35  CURLOPT_HTTPHEADER =3D&gt; $headers,
36));
37$response =3D curl_exec($curl);
38curl_close($curl);
39echo $response;</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h4 id=3D"APIGatewaySetup-QueryStructure:">Query Structure:</h4>
<p>The following will result in a SELECT * FROM 'table' query:</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: jscript; gutter: false; theme: RDark" data-theme=3D"RDark">1{
2=09'type' =3D&gt; 'select',
3    'distinct' =3D&gt; false,
4    'limit' =3D&gt; 100,
5    'offset' =3D&gt; 0,
6    'count' =3D&gt; false
7}</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h4 id=3D"APIGatewaySetup-ExampleResponse:">Example Response:</h4>
<p>This is an example of a full table of data returned via the Query API:</=
p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: jscript; gutter: false; theme: RDark" data-theme=3D"RDark">1{
2  "query": "select * from `JSDLookup` limit 100 offset 0;",
3  "results": [
4    {
5      "LookupID": 1,
6      "email": "billybob@bob.com",
7      "JSDaccountID": "supersecretID",
8      "username": "1234con1234"
9    },
10    {
11      "LookupID": 2,
12      "email": "janeydoey@jane.com",
13      "JSDaccountID": "evenmoresecretID",
14      "username": "4567con1234"
15    },
16    ...
17  ]
18}</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p></p>
</div>
</div>
<p></p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
